<translate>
==== ReplaceOnCooked ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Replaces the item with the specified one after cooking.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
ReplaceOnCooked = GrilledCheese,
</syntaxhighlight>
